{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensitive data inference sensitive data inference","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md","fileName":"Sensitive Data Inference.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensitive Data Inference","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-17 09:48\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Big Data Law and Individual Rights]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Big Data Law and Individual Rights","Data Subject","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensitive data inference sensitive data inference","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md","fileName":"Sensitive Data Inference.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensitive Data Inference","heading":"Sensitive Data Inference","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Sensitive data inference derives protected or intimate information from fields that appear nonsensitive on their own. Correlations among behavior, location, purchases, or relationships can reveal health, political, or other sensitive characteristics without asking for them directly.\n\nThe inference matters because the harm comes from what a system can conclude and use, not only from what a [[Data Subject]] intentionally disclosed. Governance must therefore examine analytical outputs as well as raw inputs.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Big Data Law and Individual Rights","Data Subject","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Inference.md::2","sourceKey":"6 -